      <marc:subfield code="a">Taking your first steps -- From your mind&apos;s eye to the palm of your hand -- Market research -- Protect yourself : all about patents, copyrights, and trademarks -- Getting the goods -- Get funded! Creative ways to fund your business -- Making the sale -- Blowing your horn -- Finding a partner -- Taking care of business.</marc:subfield>
